          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#c9f3f4] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#151b20] my-2\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"font-mono font-black text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#0e7490] uppercase tracking-wide\">\n      ⚖️ Interactive Lab: Chouldechova Fairness Trilemma Workbench\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-black bg-[#fffdf7] text-[#151b20] border border-[#151b20]\">\n      Section 2D &amp; COMPAS Proof\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-[#151b20] mt-1.5 leading-relaxed\">\n    Test $\\text{PPV} = \\left[1 + \\left(\\frac{1-p}{p}\\right)\\frac{\\text{FPR}}{\\text{TPR}}\\right]^{-1}$ across differing subgroup base prevalences $p_0 \\neq p_1$ and switch normative policies between Equalized Odds and Predictive Parity below.\n  </p>\n</div>\n"
