              "speaker": "Kaito",
              "text": "Look at the real-time metrics dashboard above us, Nova! In Preset 1, we have singleton records vulnerable to re-identification. Switch to Preset 2 to see a homogeneity trap, or Preset 4 to verify certified privacy with Earth Mover's Distance under zero point fifteen!",
              "dock": "sim"
