          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_#22bfd7] space-y-3\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#151b20]/15 pb-2 flex-wrap gap-2\">\n    <span class=\"font-mono font-black text-xs md:text-sm text-[#0e7490] uppercase tracking-wide\">\n      💡 Active Checkpoint 1: Extraterritoriality &amp; Schrems II Transfers\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-[#fff0b9] text-[#151b20] border border-[#151b20]\">\n      Formative Assessment\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-[#334155] font-sans leading-relaxed\">\n    Diagnose the legal obligations binding a non-EU cloud architecture serving European subscribers from US compute clusters:\n  </p>\n\n  <div id=\"slideCheckpointContainer\" class=\"w-full space-y-3\"></div>\n</div>\n"
