          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] my-2 text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 text-left flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <span>📐 Mathematical Formulation</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#151b20] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#eee4c8] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Empirical Sample Formulation</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-serif text-[#151b20] py-1 overflow-x-auto bg-[#f0fbfd] border border-[#0e7490] rounded-lg my-1\">\n    $$P(\\text{System Compromise}) = \\prod_{l=1}^L P\\left(\\text{Breach Layer } l \\mid \\text{Layers } 1, \\dots, l-1 \\text{ Breached}\\right)$$\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] my-2 text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 text-left flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <span>📐 Mathematical Formulation</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#151b20] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#eee4c8] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Distribution Measure</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-serif text-[#151b20] py-1 overflow-x-auto bg-[#f0fbfd] border border-[#0e7490] rounded-lg my-1\">\n    $$P(\\text{Compromise}) = (0.05)^4 = 6.25 \\times 10^{-6}$$\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Let a data</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">platform be protected by $L$ defensive security layers.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">▸</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">The probability</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">that an adversary breaches all $L$ layers is the product of conditional layer penetration probabilities: If an organization implements 4 independent layers (Perimeter WAF, Zero Trust IAM, Network Subnet Isolation, Envelope DB Encryption) each with a breach probability of $P = 0.05$, the system-wide compromise likelihood drops to:</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
