          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#151b20] my-2 overflow-x-auto text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-left flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#151b20]/15 pb-1\">\n    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <span>📊 Architecture &amp; Workflow Diagram</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#151b20]/40\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#334155]\">System Flowchart</span>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#c9f3f4] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Mermaid SVG</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"mermaid py-1 flex justify-center text-xs overflow-x-auto leading-normal\">flowchart TD\n    Init[\"1. Threshold Screening<br/>Identify affected human subjects & protected attributes\"] --> Stakeholder[\"2. Multi-Stakeholder Consultation<br/>Document risks to marginalized populations\"]\n    Stakeholder --> QuantAudit[\"3. Quantitative Fairness & Privacy Audit<br/>Compute DIR, EO Disparity, and Re-ID Risk\"]\n    QuantAudit --> RiskMatrix{\"4. Risk Classification Gate\"}\n    \n    RiskMatrix -->|Unacceptable Risk| Terminate[\"Prohibit Deployment / Scrap Pipeline\"]\n    RiskMatrix -->|High Risk| Mitigate[\"Enforce Mitigation & Human-in-the-Loop SLA\"]\n    RiskMatrix -->|Low / Minimal Risk| Deploy[\"Approved Deployment with Continuous Monitoring\"]\n\n    classDef blue fill:#c9f3f4,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef amber fill:#fff0b9,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef green fill:#e7f4c8,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef red fill:#ffd8ce,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n\n    class Init,Stakeholder blue;\n    class QuantAudit,RiskMatrix amber;\n    class Deploy green;\n    class Terminate,Mitigate red;</pre>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f6fcf4] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#15803d] text-xs my-2 leading-relaxed font-sans text-[#151b20]\">\n  <strong class=\"block mb-0.5 font-black uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-[10px] text-[#15803d]\">💡 Industrial Best Practice</strong>\n  <span class=\"font-medium\">Establish an independent Algorithmic Review Board (ARB) composed of data scientists, legal counsel, bioethicists, and impacted community representatives. No high-risk dataset or automated decision model may transition to production without unanimous </span>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">An Algorithmic Impact</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Assessment (AIA) is a mandatory procedural gate conducted prior to dataset ingestion or model training:</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
